ected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_100414.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19794897/test_pr_100414.zip)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34d3be4a-07a3-4c39-b991-8e4311781171)\r\n\r\nNote that if you click the Revert icon next to the exported property that defaults to `NAN`, nothing will happen as it's the default value. The revert icon should probably have some dedicated logic to always hide it if the default value is `NAN` and the current value isn't `NAN`.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100414#pullrequestreview-2775692175","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100414","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100414#pullrequestreview-2775692175"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100414"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-17T13:15:22Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2796368678,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mrTMm","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":f